=2 Walkthrough
* Zone into {z:Windurst Waters (S)} for a cutscene.
* Go to {z:Southern San d'Oria (S)} and talk to {n:Raustigne} (I-7) for a cutscene.
** {n:Lehko Habhoka} mentions the need for {@k} {k:Darkfire cinders|Darkfire cinder} and {@k} {k:Floelight stones|Floelight stone}, although you will not obtain the latter.
* Talk to {n:Hauberliond} (H-9) for a cutscene.
* Depending on your answers, you will be instructed to find **New-turned Earth** in one of three zones:
** {z:East Ronfaure (S)} at (J-11), this is near the {p:Survival Guide}.
** {z:La Vaule (S)} at (K-9).
*** On the rock between the hut and the wooden stable. They may not appear if there is a campaign there. If you cannot see it, sign up and butcher the campaign enemies so they leave.
*** This appears to be the result if you choose the top answers only.
** {z:Jugner Forest (S)} at (J-5) NW corner near a small stone tower. (nearest teleport {z:Batallia Downs (S)}'s Survival Guide).
* Check the **New-turned Earth** for a cutscene and {@k}{k:Darkfire Cinder|Darkfire cinder}.
* Head to the {z:Metalworks} Gunpowder Room (present day) and talk to {n:Striking Snake} (H-7) for a cutscene.
* Grab some {i:pickaxes|Pickaxe|605}.
* Head to {z:North Gustaberg (S)} locate Mining points to obtain {@k}{k:Liquid Quicksilver|Liquid quicksilver} and {@k}{k:Gelid Sulfur|Gelid sulfur}.
** See discussion for location notes. It's possible to get both from the same Mining Point.
** It can take multiple attempts to mine both key items. Bring multiple pickaxes. They can break when mining.
* Return to {n:Striking Snake} with both {p:key items|Key Item} for a brief cutscene.
** You must now wait 1 game day and change zones.
* Talk to {n:Striking Snake} after zoning and waiting 1 game day to receive {@k}{k:Beastbane Bullets|Beastbane bullets}.
* Head to {z:Fort Karugo-Narugo (S)} and talk to {n:Rotih Moalghett} (I-8) on map 2 for a cutscene.
* Head to (E/F-7) and examine the **Warding Door** to start a fight.
** **{c=red:Note: }**Summon trusts before examining the door. The battle will begin as soon as you click on the door; There is no cutscene.
** There is a 30 minute time limit for this fight.
** The battle is against 5 monsters:
*** {m:Count Furfur}: Appears to be a {p:Dark Knight}.
*** {m:Count Murmur} x2: Appear to be {p:Warriors|Warrior}.
*** {m:Tartalo} x2 ({p:Ahriman}): Appear to be {p:Black Mages|Black Mage} and love to cast -ga spells including {p:Sleepga}.
** Up to 6 people in one party may participate at once in this battle.
** Fight is trivial for any character at level 99.
* Once the monsters are defeated, check the **Warding Door** again at (E/F-7) for a final cutscene and {i:Stellar Earring|Stellar Earring|16013}.
** If your inventory is full, check the **Warding Door** again for your reward. The cutscene will not be replayed.

